Package: ConSpec
Title: Integrative Contrastive Spectral Clustering for Exploring Hidden Effects
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person(
        given = "Yunhui",
        family = "Qi",
        email = "yunhuiqistat@gmail.com",
        role = c("aut", "cre")
    )
Description: Implements contrastive spectral methods for identifying
    multivariate structure that is enriched in a target dataset relative to
    an ancillary dataset. The package includes methods for contrastive
    principal component analysis, sparse contrastive principal component
    analysis, contrastive cross-covariance analysis, sparse contrastive
    cross-covariance analysis, sample scoring, clustering, and visualization.
